o-aiming gun turrets. Don't worry about ammunition limits and give them hell!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001190/extras/dd9eac0ae2d616c12e1663b138000165.poster.avif?t=1682338267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001190/extras/dd9eac0ae2d616c12e1663b138000165.webm?t=1682338267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001190/extras/dd9eac0ae2d616c12e1663b138000165.mp4?t=1682338267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br></li><li> <strong>blood &amp; gore</strong>: Nothing feels better than crushing zombies and turning them into piles of blood and body parts. Enjoy your last moments!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001190/extras/70c3a8fa7750cb4b0b9b39d2715ebce3.poster.avif?t=1682338267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001190/extras/70c3a8fa7750cb4b0b9b39d2715ebce3.webm?t=1682338267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001190/extras/70c3a8fa7750cb4b0b9b39d2715ebce3.mp4?t=1682338267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
